{"seq":1,"slug":"urlsession-networking","title":"URLSession 网络请求","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-networking-data-layer/urlsession-networking","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"urlsession-requests","title":"URLSession 请求基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-networking-data-layer/urlsession-networking/urlsession-requests","wordCount":1350,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"async-await-networking","title":"async/await 异步网络","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-networking-data-layer/urlsession-networking/async-await-networking","wordCount":1662,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"upload-download-background","title":"上传下载与后台会话","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-networking-data-layer/urlsession-networking/upload-download-background","wordCount":1625,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"urlsession-网络请求-简介\">URLSession 网络请求 简介</h1><p><code>URLSession</code> 是 iOS 网络请求的基础——所有 HTTP 通信（除非用第三方库，而第三方库底层也多是它）都建立在它之上。本章讲清 URLSession 的核心用法：先是基本的请求构建（<code>URLRequest</code>、方法/头/体、<code>dataTask</code> 与响应处理），然后是现代的 <strong>async/await 网络</strong>（<code>data(for:)</code> 把回调式 API 变成线性的异步代码、配合 <code>URLSession</code> 的结构化并发），最后是上传下载与后台会话（大文件传输、<code>uploadTask</code>/<code>downloadTask</code>、应用挂起后仍能继续的后台会话）。掌握 URLSession，是写出可靠 iOS 网络代码的起点。</p>\n"}